{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":207700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9882.747236,"text":"Doch nach dem Verlust des Tors des Kapitäns erzielte Indien nur 36 Runden und verlor sieben Tore, womit die Innings beendet waren."},{"kind":"text","t":10286.444875,"text":"But after losing their wicket captain, India scored only 36 runs and lost seven wickets, ending the innings."},{"kind":"audio","t":10342.209478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10343.562124,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10345.230885,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10346.959988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10348.731634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":10350.717153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":10350.903403,"samples":6192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":19854.416301999998,"text":"Sie haben normalerweise ein besonderes Angebot an Speisen, Getränken und Unterhaltung, um die Gäste bei Laune zu halten und dafür zu sorgen, dass sie bleiben."},{"kind":"text","t":20236.763005,"text":"They usually have a special offer of food, drinks, and entertainment to keep guests happy and ensure they stay."},{"kind":"audio","t":20290.423571,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":20291.726341,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":20293.456886,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20295.246940999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20297.031767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20297.841666,"samples":20360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":29237.498007000002,"text":"Del Potro hatte im zweiten Satz einen frühen Vorteil, doch auch diesmal war ein Tie-Break erforderlich, nachdem das 6 zu 6 erreicht wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":29694.960408,"text":"Del Potro took an early lead in the second set, but once again a tie-break was needed after it reached 6-6."},{"kind":"audio","t":29749.647578999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29750.822928,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29752.482957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29754.619913000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29756.580044000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29757.452607,"samples":22160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":41608.525463000005,"text":"Das Internet verbindet sowohl Elemente der Massenkommunikation als auch der zwischenmenschlichen Kommunikation."},{"kind":"text","t":41831.413869,"text":"The Internet combines elements of mass communication as well as interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"audio","t":41877.166834,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41879.165582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":41880.400791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41882.174361000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41884.052848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":41884.195192,"samples":7160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":55065.173832,"text":"Die Zusammensetzung dieser Kristalle entspricht der Zusammensetzung, die im Urin betroffene Haustiere gefunden wurden, wenn man sie mittels Infrarotspektropos bedacht."},{"kind":"text","t":55445.602177,"text":"The composition of these crystals corresponds to the composition found in the urine of affected pets when analyzed using an infrared spectrometer."},{"kind":"audio","t":55504.324872000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55505.998221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55507.748225,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":55509.463176000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55511.071627000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55512.875382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55514.720629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55515.606803,"samples":21424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":64341.912396,"text":"Auf einigen Routen setzen die größeren Firmen ihre eigenen Flugzeuge ein, aber auf anderen Routen und bei kleineren Firmen traten Schwierigkeiten auf."},{"kind":"text","t":64678.892655999996,"text":"On some routes, larger companies use their own aircraft, but difficulties arose on other routes with smaller companies."},{"kind":"audio","t":64729.099644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":64730.45564500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64732.103856,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":64733.784155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64735.588319999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64737.33715200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":64737.534149,"samples":11592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":72112.144489,"text":"Manche Atome haben instabile Kerne, was bedeutet, dass sie schon bei geringem oder gar keinem Anstoß zerfallen."},{"kind":"text","t":72398.49854,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means they decay even with minimal or no stimulation."},{"kind":"audio","t":72450.526108,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":72452.063172,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":72453.813896,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72455.607146,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":72457.415898,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":72457.691533,"samples":11360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":86641.08554,"text":"Im selben Monat schoss ein weiteres Passagierflugzeug über das Ende einer Landebahn in Mashhad hinaus und stieß mit einer Mauer zusammen."},{"kind":"text","t":87000.528439,"text":"That same month, another passenger plane flew off the end of a runway in Mashhad and collided with a wall."},{"kind":"audio","t":87049.080776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":87050.308284,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":87052.114292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87053.841492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":87055.574801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":320,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87056.51648800001,"samples":21560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":89388.274391,"text":"wobei 17 Menschen ums Leben kamen."},{"kind":"text","t":89566.805844,"text":"17 people lost their lives in the incident."},{"kind":"audio","t":89613.384842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89615.005962,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89615.964855,"samples":22664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":103236.811604,"text":"Fast alle sind Sandstrände mit sicheren Bademöglichkeiten und die meisten bieten Schatten, der von Pohutukawa-Bäumen gespendet wird."},{"kind":"text","t":103584.258187,"text":"Almost all are sandy beaches with safe swimming conditions, and most provide shade from pohutukawa trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":103634.972229,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103636.230843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103637.855218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":103639.57055,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103641.38472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103642.159526,"samples":19760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":114366.29083700001,"text":"Zu den beliebten Sportarten gehören Fußball, Basketball, Volleyball, Wasserball, Fechten, Rugby, Radfahren, Eishockey, Rollhockey und Formel 1 Motorsport."},{"kind":"text","t":114828.928307,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby, cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and Formula 1 racing."},{"kind":"audio","t":114883.188927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114884.581383,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114886.02802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114887.772155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114889.544112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114891.296991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114893.08468100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114894.7579,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"audio","t":114894.908677,"samples":56,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":122296.939298,"text":"Im warmen Klima des Mittleren Ostens kamen Häusern keine so große Bedeutung zu."},{"kind":"text","t":122575.044844,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, houses did not hold such great significance."},{"kind":"audio","t":122621.188576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122622.594923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":122624.32723,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122626.10899200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122626.503275,"samples":14128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":131125.739175,"text":"Der Archipel liegt 120 km nördlich der Halbinsel. Die größte ist King George Island mit der Siedlung Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"text","t":131452.311169,"text":"The archipelago is located 120 km north of the peninsula. The largest is King George Island, with the settlement of Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"audio","t":131498.939751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131500.49635399997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131502.302443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131504.16204199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":131504.361231,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":131539.598087,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131541.05772399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":131542.72201899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131544.546155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":131544.976863,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":138205.637505,"text":"Der Kohlsaft ändert seine Farbe, je nachdem wie sauer oder basisch alkalisch die Chemikalie ist."},{"kind":"text","t":138562.48309499997,"text":"The color of the cabbage juice changes depending on whether the chemical is acidic or basic/alkaline."},{"kind":"audio","t":138612.87304799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138614.25448799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138616.01593899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138617.75420499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138619.517689,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":138619.92012499998,"samples":12560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147649.576818,"text":"Die Brücke soll im September 2017 vollständig den Betrieb aufnehmen. Es wird erwartet, dass die brasilianischen Zollpunkte dann fertiggestellt sein werden."},{"kind":"text","t":147978.52070199998,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to begin full operation in September 2017. It is expected that the Brazilian customs posts will be completed by then."},{"kind":"audio","t":148026.617424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148028.91343999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148030.15018099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148031.90461199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":148032.179225,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":148067.255129,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148068.665282,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148070.474234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148071.875553,"samples":30096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":158436.451466,"text":"Die Feuchtigkeit auf ihren Händen reagiert mit den äußeren Schichten, was sich komisch anfühlt und eine Art Schutzschicht bildet."},{"kind":"text","t":158813.12625099998,"text":"The moisture on their hands reacts with the outer layers, which feels strange and forms a kind of protective layer."},{"kind":"audio","t":158861.15544099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158862.74190899997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158864.70893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158866.80185,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158868.855421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158870.125553,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":164524.53365199998,"text":"Eine Bombe explodierte vor dem Bürogebäude des Generalgouverneurs."},{"kind":"text","t":164752.646261,"text":"A bomb exploded in front of the governor-general’s office building."},{"kind":"audio","t":164801.127121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164802.450744,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164804.264424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":164804.872469,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":173377.124067,"text":"Der marokkanische Sultan baute die Stadt als Daelbeda wieder auf und sie wurde von spanischen Händlern, die dort Handelsstützpunkte einrichteten, Casablanca genannt."},{"kind":"text","t":173878.255966,"text":"The Moroccan sultan rebuilt the city as Daelbeda, and it was named Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading posts there."},{"kind":"audio","t":173931.58118799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173933.009848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173934.75089899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173936.57325199997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":173938.342495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173940.15785699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173941.750825,"samples":31392,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":186573.754797,"text":"Er wurde von Wong Kang-Seng, dem stellvertretenden Premierminister Singapurs, begrüßt und sprach mit Lee Hsing-Long, dem Premierminister Singapurs,"},{"kind":"text","t":187030.19895599998,"text":"He was greeted by Wong Kang-Seng, Singapore’s Deputy Prime Minister, and spoke with Lee Hsing-Long, Singapore’s Prime Minister."},{"kind":"audio","t":187080.50868899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187081.82645199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":187083.64197499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187085.29096699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187087.06291399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187088.836293,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187090.500027,"samples":32592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":187790.73982999998,"text":"über Handels- und Terrorismusangelegenheiten."},{"kind":"text","t":187914.096047,"text":"on trade and terrorism issues."},{"kind":"audio","t":187954.10014899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187955.46987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":187955.61721199998,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":200689.028765,"text":"Die Atombombe basiert auf dem Prinzip, dass man Energie benötigt."},{"kind":"text","t":200921.39653899998,"text":"The atomic bomb is based on the principle that energy is required."},{"kind":"audio","t":200963.69887899997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200965.27634299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200967.12503599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200968.06550099998,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":201965.84033399998,"text":"um einen Kern mit vielen Protonen und Neutronen zusammenzusetzen."},{"kind":"text","t":202171.88453799998,"text":"to form a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":202215.039452,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202216.53253899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202218.17108499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":202218.30693,"samples":1896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":207313.614259,"text":"Für die Archipel und Seen brauchen Sie nicht unbedingt eine Yacht."},{"kind":"text","t":207566.825945,"text":"You don’t necessarily need a yacht for the archipelagos and lakes."},{"kind":"audio","t":207608.67464299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207610.45982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":207612.24722999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":207612.45590399997,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":217703.270941,"code":1005}]}